  <name>USB Energy Monitor</name>
  <summary>Monitor and control USB ports and energy usage</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      USB Energy Monitor is a comprehensive tool for monitoring and managing USB ports and their energy consumption.
      Track power usage, manage connected devices, and optimize your USB port energy efficiency.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Real-time monitoring of USB port energy consumption</li>
      <li>Device connection tracking and management</li>
      <li>Power usage statistics and visualization</li>
      <li>USB port control capabilities</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  
